  "aboutTitle": "A small studio with a big love of flowers",
  "aboutLead": "Petalbound is a small flower studio in Marlow Bay. We arrange everything by hand, in the morning, for the day\u0027s orders.",
  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "We started with one bucket of tulips and a bicycle. Today we still buy from the same few growers, and we still work in small batches so nothing sits in a cold room for a week.",
    "Every bouquet is wrapped in recycled kraft paper and tied with a ribbon. We do not use floral foam, and we compost every stem that is not sold.",
    "Our team delivers across the city by van and bike. If you would rather collect, the studio door is open from eight in the morning."
  ],
  "care": [
    {
      "title": "Trim the stems",
      "text": "Cut about two centimetres at an angle and put them in clean water straight away."
    },
    {
      "title": "Change the water",
      "text": "Fresh water every other day keeps flowers looking good for much longer."
    },
    {
      "title": "Keep them cool",
      "text": "Away from direct sun, radiators and ripening fruit."
    }
  ],
